    "guideline_note": "Signs follow the MoHFW ASHA job aid listed in primary_source. Signs marked NOT_FOUND_IN_JOB_AID need another cited source or removal. Only Hindi and English are being claimed as verified-for-demo; other languages are unverified machine-generated phrases kept for experimentation. The system flags danger signs from a fixed list and gives no diagnosis or treatment advice.",
